| Position write (non-confidential) | All cost centers | None by flag alone | None by flag alone | None by flag alone | Assigned with ALL_WRITE |
| Compensation data read | Implicit full | None by flag alone | None by flag alone | None by flag alone | Assigned with ALL_READ or ALL_WRITE confidential grant |
