| Finance Review — view queue | All cost centers | None | None | Assigned cost centers only | None |
| Finance Review — approve/reject | All cost centers | None | None | Assigned cost centers only | None |
| Excel export | Full | Per report access | Per report access | Per report access (assigned CCs only) | Assigned cost centers only |
